<%- include('partials/header', { title: "Lye's Blog" }) %>

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Lye's digital garden · since now</p>
    <h1>闲人 Lye，<span>忙时候。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">收集路上的想法、代码与偶然发现。这里不追赶热点，只认真保存值得再读一遍的东西。</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="hero-note">
    <strong>空闲不是停下</strong>
    <p>它是给好奇心留一个入口。读篇文章，聊几句，或者扫一局雷。</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<p class="section-kicker">FIELD NOTES / <%= posts ? posts.length : 0 %> ENTRIES</p>
<h2>最近写下的</h2>
<div class="post-list">
  <% if (posts && posts.length > 0) { %>
    <% posts.forEach(function(post) { %>
      <article class="post-card">
        <div>
          <h3><a href="/posts/<%= post.id %>"><%= post.title %></a></h3>
          <p class="post-meta"><%= post.created_at %> · BY <%= post.username %> · <%= post.view_count || 0 %> READS</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% }); %>
  <% } else { %>
    <p class="empty-state">纸页还是空的。第一篇文章会从这里开始。</p>
  <% } %>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
